Package: majoris-characters
Architecture: any
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}, fonts-noto-color-emoji
Recommends: ibus, gir1.2-ibus-1.0, python3-gi
Description: Native character utility for Majoris
 Provides a native GTK Unicode character browser with a virtualized grid,
 names and code point search, emoji and symbol collections, Unicode block
 and script filters, sequence-aware inspection, installed font coverage,
 font comparisons, legacy character sets, exact emoji variations, and
 localized emoji annotation search, and a multi-character composer with
 native editing and exact clipboard representations. Includes a compact picker,
 desktop search integration, and an optional IBus input source.
